To pass credentials in JavaScript code for `react-native-fbsdk-next`, you can use the `credentials` object provided by Facebook SDK for React Native. Here's an example of how to do it:

1. First, make sure you have installed `react-native-fbsdk-next` and set up your Facebook app ID in your project.

